#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD9703 expect=violation domain=ADAE
#note "PRESENCE half of the TRTEMFL pair: the indexed flag TREM01FL is in the dataset but the overall TRTEMFL column is not present at all. The value rules (TRTEMFL in Requirements.Variables.All) take a dataset SKIP here, so without this rule the absence goes unreported -- that is why this rule was minted."
#expectViolationCount 1
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS subclass=AE
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col ASEQ     type=Num
col AEDECOD  type=Char
col TREM01FL type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | HEADACHE | Y
